{"backendEventChannel":"assistant","backendEventContent":"{\n  \"when\": {\n    \"accepted\": false\n  },\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"accepted\": false,\n    \"decision\": \"rejected\",\n    \"revision\": 6,\n    \"guidelinePath\": \"docs\/table-count-guideline.md\",\n    \"guidelineSha256\": \"bf453d7d516b597e78db496a5e16ea4b07a2ee6726d31f2e96bc611685dcc462\",\n    \"opusDecision\": \"rejected\",\n    \"workflowInput\": {\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Opus 5.5 と GPT-6.1 Sol の両方の敵対的レビューを経て、high\/middle の未解決指摘がない\",\n        \"数値はすべて results\/ のファイルに基づき、未計測は明記されている\",\n        \"ガイドライン本文のSQLがラボで実行され、結果が確認されている\",\n        \"テーブル設計ごとに推奨方法と根拠がある\",\n        \"データ・インデックスによるロック要因と、その事前検知方法がある\"\n      ],\n      \"constraints\": [\n        \"対象はMySQLのサポート中バージョン(8.4 LTS, 9.7 LTS, 26.10 Innovation)のみ\",\n        \"接続先はローカルのcomposeの検証環境のみ\",\n        \"コミットとpushはしない\",\n        \"人間が読む文書は日本語\"\n      ],\n      \"guidelinePath\": \"docs\/table-count-guideline.md\",\n      \"requestedWork\": \"複数の巨大データサービスを運用する開発者向けに、MySQLテーブルの全件カウント(業務上のWHEREなし)を、サービス性能を落とさず全件ロックせず最速で取得する方法のガイドラインを、計測結果に基づいて日本語で作成する。良い方法を洗い出し、あらゆるデータベース\/テーブル設計で成り立つことを敵対的に検証する。\"\n    },\n    \"findings\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-STEP-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 SQL 0〜4、§8、§11\",\n        \"scenario\": \"開発者が本文と同じ手順として split_count を使うと、タイマー由来の1317でも停止し、3024では対象表のPENDINGを確認せず幅を縮める。本文で追加した安全規則を含む一連の手順の実行証拠になっていない。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"bench\/countlib.py classify は3024を無条件にtimer_3024、1317をstopped:1317_unknownにする。幅縮小の前にPENDING確認がない。results\/requested_11-EXP-O2-1-versions-*.jsonには3節しかなく、requested_12-EXP-6.jsonのsession_limit_and_lost_hintは失敗している。\",\n        \"impact\": \"本文SQLを実行して結果を確認する受入条件を満たさず、停止・継続の運用判断も本文と実装で異なる。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"カウンタ差分、PENDING確認、上限超過成功の停止を実装し、split_count自体を通して成功・タイマー・第三者KILL・MDL待ち・その他エラーを検証する。失われた型、境界、3列以上、PARTITION内の節も個別保存と上限付きで完了する。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R6-MDL-AS-TIMEOUT\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 打ち切りの判定とエラーの表\",\n        \"scenario\": \"先行する読者がALTERを待たせ、その後ろでカウントが500msの時間切れになる。現在のループは幅を縮め続け、分割不可の経路へ誘導する。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"results\/requested_13-EXP-O2-2.json sections.other_stop_paths.pending_ddl_1205は3024を4回記録し、status=unsplittable:3024_min_width。bench\/countlib.pyの幅縮小経路にPENDING確認がない。\",\n        \"impact\": \"DDL待ちを走査時間不足と誤認し、上限延長の判断に進み得る。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"本文の修正を実装へ反映し、この同じ反例で幅を変更せず未完了停止することを確認する。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-IMPACT-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§3 作業セットが大きいとき、§11\",\n        \"scenario\": \"作業セットがプールに近いサービスで、表の結果を安全性の根拠にカウントする。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_30、31、32は実行済みだが、33、60、61、62、63はskipped=true。高負荷は各方式1回で対照がない。requested_31のwrite p95はdefaultで2.42→26.58ms、split_nosleepで1.96→16.34ms。\",\n        \"impact\": \"主要目的であるサービス性能への影響を判定できない。本文の未完了という留保は正しいが、同節の悪化なしという判断は支持できない。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"R9の不足反復と同負荷・同じ長さの対照窓を先に実行し、p50だけでなくp95、p99、エラー、回復とミス率を比較する。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-REPL-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§7 レプリカの手順\",\n        \"scenario\": \"停止レプリカの件数をprimaryの特定のコミット位置と照合する。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_25 sections.stop_count_resume.trialsの3回すべてでid_primary_logged_at_that_gtidとgtid_maps_to_applied_idがnull。setup_facts.status.Executed_Gtid_Setにはprimary UUIDに加えてreplica UUIDの1-6もある。bench\/requested\/25-EXP-R15.pyはprimaryの全GTID集合とreplicaの全集合を文字列の完全一致で比較している。\",\n        \"impact\": \"安定したレプリカ状態と件数一致は実証したが、primaryのコミット記録との対応は実証していない。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"replica固有GTIDを含む集合の文字列一致をやめ、対象書込みのGTIDと単調増加IDを記録し、集合包含・差分で適用済み位置を対応付ける。3回の対応一致を出力する。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-NOISE-FLOOR-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§2 ノイズの下限、§3\",\n        \"scenario\": \"通常数msのwrite p99が100〜200msに増えても、256.91msより小さいため影響なしと判断される。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"impact_baseline_end.jsonのwrite p99は前5.9／中256.91／後7.89ms、impact_baseline_mid.jsonは5.58／118.94／6.2ms。requested_31のdefaultとsplit_nosleepにはp95、p99上昇があるが、§3はこの旧閾値と存在しない高負荷の別反復で退けている。\",\n        \"impact\": \"無影響の判断に必要な検出力を示していない。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"旧実験群の最大値を普遍的な効果閾値にしない。同負荷・同じ長さの無処置窓を反復し、周期的な停止やハーネスの影響を調べ、判断可能な差と未判定を分ける。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-INSTRUMENT-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§3、§8 PRIMARYの影響\",\n        \"scenario\": \"カウント中のp50低下を、負荷による害がない証拠とする。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_26のPRIMARY待ちなし3回はread p50が1.06→0.66、1.15→0.78、1.17→0.72ms。requested_30〜32と合わせた17腕中16腕でread p50が低下する。対照となるCPUのみの腕はない。\",\n        \"impact\": \"CPU稼働、キャッシュ状態などによる有利な効果と競合による悪化を分離できない。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"CPUのみの対照と無処置対照で比較する。VMの起床遅延が原因とは断定しない。同じ表の走査によるキャッシュ温存・温暖化も候補であり、対照が終わるまで無悪化の断定を弱める。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-WRITE-SHAPE-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 最速の一般化、§2、§3、§8\",\n        \"scenario\": \"INSERT／DELETEや索引更新が多いサービスへ、非索引列UPDATEだけで得た順位を適用する。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"bench\/experiments.py DENSEとbench\/reqruns.py DENSE_WRITEはstatusの点UPDATEのみ。RATESの書込みは100または200文\/秒。requested_51は未実行。[InnoDB Multi-Versioning](https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/innodb-multi-versioning.html)は、新しい二次索引ページやdelete markによりクラスタ索引参照が必要になる条件を説明している。\",\n        \"impact\": \"最小索引と1文の順位、ステップ上限の成立範囲が書込み形状に対して未検証。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"既存ワークロードを明記し、INSERT／DELETEを含む負荷で比較する。索引列UPDATEの腕は、本文が禁じる可変カーソルの使用を推奨する根拠にはしない。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-LONG-UNDO-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 判断フロー、§7、§8 HLL\",\n        \"scenario\": \"DDL予定がないため、数時間かかるprimaryの1文カウントへ上限を延長する。カウント自身のread viewがpurgeを妨げても、監視表の動作は長いトランザクションを探すだけである。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"§1の延長分岐はDDLとバックアップしか条件にしない。§8のHLL行は停止条件を持たない。requested_20の43〜47秒のPRIMARYカウントでHLL 4309／4709、requested_31の約12秒で2389。長時間の実測はない。\",\n        \"impact\": \"undo滞留と回復コストを上限なく許す経路が残る。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"予想所要、許容undo増加、サービス指標を延長の開始条件と停止条件に入れ、長時間なら分割か専用レプリカを優先する。HLLはundoバイト数ではなく、書込み文数だけから普遍的な安全限界を算出しない。長時間域は未計測とする。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-S6-MONITOR-RECHECK-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§8 監視の喪失、bench\/countlib.py CountMonitor\",\n        \"scenario\": \"SQL Mに成功して監視を開始した後、管理操作でMDL計装が無効になる。本文は停止を約束するが、監視は空のmetadata_locksを正常として読み続ける。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"CountMonitor.runはmonitor_readyをループ前に1回だけ呼ぶ。bench\/requested\/45-EXP-SOL-6.pyは、計装をNOにした後でmon.start()しており、開始後の無効化を試していない。raw結果もmonitor_started_while_disabledである。\",\n        \"impact\": \"監視の正常性を失った状態でジョブが継続する。既存試験は開始時拒否だけを実証している。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"実行中も監視に必要な計装の有効性を確認し、喪失時は停止フラグを先に立てる。監視の準備完了を同期してから計装を無効化する試験を追加する。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-S6-INCREMENTAL-DETECT-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§10 増分の条件\",\n        \"scenario\": \"TABLE_IDとUPDATE_TIMEが一致することを、閉じた範囲が不変だった証拠として再利用する。同じ時刻粒度内の変更やメタデータの失効を現在の試験は攻撃していない。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"bench\/requested\/52-EXP-R16.pyのbroken_premisesは各変更前にtime.sleep(1.1)する。requested_52はその条件下での検出結果だけである。[TABLES Table](https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/information-schema-tables-table.html)はUPDATE_TIMEが再起動だけでなくInnoDB辞書キャッシュからの退避でも保持されないと説明する。\",\n        \"impact\": \"補助的な検出を完全な変更検知と読める。閉鎖範囲の不変性が運用で保証されている場合の増分方式自体は否定しない。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"両メタデータの一致は不変性の証明ではないと明記し、不変性を保証できない場合は再カウントする。同一秒の変更を試験し、検出可能な条件を限定する。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-S6-REPLICA-CLEANUP-01\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\",\n        \"section\": \"§7 レプリカの手順\",\n        \"scenario\": \"SQL_THREAD停止後にCOUNTが時間切れ、KILL、接続断で失敗し、そのまま通常の停止規則に従って作業を終える。\",\n        \"evidence\": \"§1はエラー時に止まるとする一方、§7には異常終了時の適用再開と状態確認の具体的な手順がない。bench\/requested\/25-EXP-R15.pyにはfinallyでSTARTと追いつき確認があるが、これらの故障注入結果はない。\",\n        \"impact\": \"意図しない長時間の適用停止、読み先への復帰漏れ、relay log増加につながり得る。\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"停止前の状態を記録し、この作業が止めたapplierを異常終了時も復旧・確認する責任を明記する。HA候補の扱いと長時間のrelay log容量は未計測として示す。\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"opusFindings\": [\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"results\/requested_30, 31, 32: 3 of 8 scripts ran. requested_33 has skipped:true. The 60-63 scripts did not run, so high load has 1 repeat and there is no control.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-IMPACT-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"The core goal of not degrading the service is unanswered. The text correctly says so.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Run R9 repeats and both controls first, then judge from same-load control windows.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"A developer reads the R9 table as evidence that a full-index read does not hurt a working set close to pool size.\",\n        \"section\": \"§3 作業セットが大きいとき, §11\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"bench\/countlib.py:354-357 (classify) and :413-421 (halving). requested_11-*.json have only sizes_and_nulls, R2_nullable_composite and R3_desc. requested_12-EXP-6.json section_errors: session_limit_and_lost_hint.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-STEP-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"The prescribed procedure has not run as a whole, which fails the acceptance criterion that body SQL be executed.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Implement both rules in countlib, re-run 13 and the MDL path, finish R6 and later sections, and fix the long-success arm.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The guideline's error table prescribes the counter classification and PENDING check, but split_count still stops on every 1317 and halves on 3024 without checking PENDING. Type, boundary-delete and lossy-cursor arms have no result.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 SQL 0-4, §6, §8, §11\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_13-EXP-O2-2.json other_stop_paths.pending_ddl_1205: four 3024 errors, status unsplittable:3024_min_width.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R6-MDL-AS-TIMEOUT\",\n        \"impact\": \"A wrong branch during a DDL wait, on the path that can extend the stall.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"The text is corrected. Implement the check in the loop and re-run this arm until the status is a stop.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"With a pending ALTER and a 500 ms limit, the job halves four times and reports unsplittable, sending the developer toward the unsplittable branch, which includes extending the limit, instead of stopping.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 打ち切りの判定, エラーの表\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_25-EXP-R15.json stop_count_resume.trials[*].id_primary_logged_at_that_gtid and gtid_maps_to_applied_id are null.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-REPL-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"An unverified claim in the point-in-time recommendation. Everything else in the finding is measured and matches.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Produce the mapping in the script. The lab can do this, so it is not to be replaced by an unmeasured label.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"§7's table says the method gives the value at 'その GTID 位置', while the mapping to the primary's committed log is null. A developer reconciling against the primary cannot rely on the position.\",\n        \"section\": \"§7 レプリカの手順\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"impact_baseline_mid.json write p99 5.58\/118.94\/6.2; impact_baseline_end.json 5.9\/256.91\/7.89; impact_lock_baseline.json 7.87\/240.31\/6.2; impact_replica_control_no_count.json 6.94\/262.96\/8.23 (before\/during\/after, nothing running). requested_31 high: write p99 19.17 to 99.04 (default), 13.68 to 125.82 (no-wait), 17.93 to 21.25 (duty 50); write p95 2.42 to 26.58, 1.96 to 16.34, 2.0 to 1.93. The series_10s values also show spikes without a count (149.93 ms in the baseline of high\/split_duty50), so these high-load values are neither shown to be an effect nor shown to be noise.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-NOISE-FLOOR-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"The test cannot detect tail degradation below about 40 times normal, and its unexplained 'during' inflation may be a harness artefact. 'No degradation' statements inherit that.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Find why idle 'during' windows are inflated. Replace the floor with per-load control runs compared over equal window lengths, and report p95 and p99. Remove the 'other run' argument for high load until repeats exist.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"§2 sets 'effect' at write p99 above 256.91 ms and §3 uses that to dismiss values. A count that raised write p99 from 6 ms to 200 ms would be called no effect. The three floor values are the 'during' windows of idle runs, whose own before and after windows are 40 times lower. They come from the first experiment group, one of them with the unexplained background read, at one load only. §3 dismisses large write p99 as not seen in 'another run of the same method', but high load has only one run per method.\",\n        \"section\": \"§2 ノイズの下限, §3\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_26: PRIMARY no-wait read p50 1.06 to 0.66, 1.15 to 0.78, 1.17 to 0.72; write p50 1.95 to 1.15, 1.77 to 1.11, 1.88 to 1.02. k_created 1.0 to 0.89, 1.13 to 0.97, 1.09 to 1.0; duty 50 1.28 to 1.05, 1.31 to 0.87. requested_30-32: 8 of 9 arms lower (only high\/default rises, 0.40 to 0.43).\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-INSTRUMENT-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"The latency comparisons behind §3 and §8 may be biased toward 'no harm', particularly for PRIMARY.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Run a control that burns server CPU without touching the buffer pool (EXP-O6-CPU-CONTROL). If p50 falls the same way, state the offset and judge methods against that control. Until then, weaken the §8 sentence.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Read p50 falls during the count in 16 of 17 arms, and falls most for the heaviest method. A count cannot truly speed up unrelated point reads. A likely cause (reasoning) is that a busy server keeps the Docker VM's vCPUs awake, removing idle wake-up latency from the baseline. An offset like that can hide real degradation, so 'no worse than before' is not evidence of no harm.\",\n        \"section\": \"§3, §8 'PRIMARY でサービス遅延の悪化は見られません'\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"bench\/experiments.py:14 DENSE write_sql UPDATE t_dense SET status=...; bench\/reqruns.py:9, :103 RATES. EXP-3 (51-EXP-3.py) was skipped and has no concurrent writer on the counted index.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-WRITE-SHAPE-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"'Fastest' and 'choose the smallest immutable index' are unproven for write-heavy services, which are the target audience. The text does not disclose the write shape.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Disclose the workload shape in §2 and §3. Run EXP-O6-WRITE-MIX and EXP-3, then state which ranking holds under index-touching writes.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Every timing and impact arm uses point UPDATEs of a non-indexed column, so the counted index k_created is never modified. An InnoDB secondary-index read must check the clustered record when a page's max_trx_id is too new for the read view (reasoning from documented MVCC behaviour). With inserts, deletes or indexed-column updates across the index, the smallest index and the ranking of statement against split may differ, and the 500 ms step may start timing out. Rate was at most 100 writes\/s (low) and 200 writes\/s (high), so undo effects also scale unseen.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 '書き込みと同時', §3, §8, §1 SQL 3\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_20: FORCE PRIMARY 43 s at about 100 writes\/s reached HLL 4309 and 4709 with write p50 above floor; requested_31: 12.48 s at 200 writes\/s reached 2389. No run lasts longer than about 47 s. §8 row 'HLL が増え続ける'.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-LONG-UNDO-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Undo growth and slowed purge on a production primary from following the recommended branch. The size of this at long durations is unmeasured and the text does not say so.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Add undo as a gate on the extended statement: a limit derived from write rate and tolerated HLL, an explicit stop when HLL exceeds a threshold, and a rule to prefer split or replica when the expected time is long. Mark long durations unmeasured. Fix the §8 row action.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"A developer has no DDL or backup and takes the 'fastest' branch on a table that needs hours, with a long extended limit. The history list grows for the whole statement, and purge cannot progress past its read view. The flow gates only on DDL and backup. §8's action for HLL growth is to look for a long transaction, which here is the job itself, and it does not stop.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 結論の表と判断フロー, §7, §8 停止条件\",\n        \"severity\": \"middle\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"bench\/requested\/11-EXP-O2-1-versions.py:159, :169; results\/requested\/11-EXP-O2-1-versions.log has no R6_types line for any version; 6088 s total is about 5 times the 1200 s limit; bench\/countlib.py:431 checks equality only.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-WALK-CEILING-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"With the round trip kept, these lossy paths should stop, which supports the guideline's rule. A lost rule or a client bug means an endless load or a silent over-count.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Add a job ceiling: maximum steps derived from the estimate with margin, plus a runtime limit, and a server-side strict-advance check. Give every R6 arm a max_steps value and report which arm loops.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Rule 3 checks only NULL and a repeated value. A cursor that goes backward is not caught for integer and decimal keys, which have no round trip, or anywhere the round trip is skipped. The walk then over-counts or never ends, and there is no step or runtime ceiling. This also probably explains script 11. Its negative-control arms timestamp_dst_zone_no_roundtrip and latin1_no_roundtrip disable the round trip with no max_steps. A display time that maps back an hour, or '?' sorting before the current key, restarts the walk. This cause is reasoning, not measured.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 SQL 4 規則 3, §11 item 3\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"§8 SQL; bench\/countlib.py:487; requested_12 monitoring_statements.threads ran only the first clause.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-THREADS-FILTER-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"False stops and possible non-completion.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Scope the filter or define what counts as relevant, set a retry limit, and execute the full statement.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The thread-state filter is server-wide and LIKE 'Waiting for table%' also matches 'Waiting for table metadata lock'. A DDL wait on any unrelated table stops the job, and nothing limits retries. On a busy server the count may never finish. The direction is safe. The added OR clause is also unexecuted.\",\n        \"section\": \"§8 停止条件のSQL\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"impact_mdl_long_count_then_ddl.json notes seconds 18.68, ddl_seconds 13.74; requested_21, 22 medians.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-MDL-HEADLINE-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"The headline magnitude is not comparable with the numbers next to it. The direction stands.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"State that the wait equals the statement's remaining time, and re-measure in the same batch as R8 or label it in §1.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"§1 quotes a 13.74 s ALTER wait next to statement medians of 5.72-6.90 s. An ALTER issued 5 s into such a statement would wait about 1-2 s. The 13.74 s comes from a first-group count that took 18.68 s, unexplained against the re-measured times.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1, §5 MDL の連鎖\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_21 runs[0].evict.disk_reads 19309; cold and warm disk_reads 61374 and 61165; pool_before 98295 pages in requested_30.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-COLD-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Overstated control. The ranking is probably unaffected, but a truly cold statement is unmeasured.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Describe it as partial eviction, or restart a private server or use a real eviction method.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The text says cold means just after replacing the buffer pool. The eviction read about 300 MB in the run checked, on a 98,295-page pool, because a scan stays in the old part of the LRU list. Cold and warm disk reads are nearly equal, so the cache state was not controlled, and the reasoning that k_created exceeds the pool is not the only explanation.\",\n        \"section\": \"§3 時間\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_20 watcher_interesting: [7,'Suspending',25637,null,null]; bench\/reqlib.py:143.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-QUIET-GATE-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Text misdescribes the state and the gate is useless. The conclusion that the cause is unidentified stands.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Fix the gate filter and correct the sentence.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"§2 says one running statement remained during the gate. The watcher shows a long-lived thread in state Suspending with a time near server uptime and no statement text. That looks like a system thread the gate does not exclude, so the gate cannot pass. That identification is reasoning.\",\n        \"section\": \"§2 初回の背景読み取り\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"impact_count_on_replica_t_repl.json write p50 2.06\/4.22\/1.41; impact_replica_control_no_count.json during 2.0.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-REPLICA-ISOLATION-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"The benefit may be understated or misattributed; one trial per arm from the first group.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"State the shared-host limit and that the primary benefit is not cleanly shown here.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"With the count on the replica, primary write p50 was 4.22 ms against 2.06 before and 2.0 in the control, above the guideline's own 1.94 floor. A count on another server should not do that, unless the shared host couples them. The table presents this as an avoidance effect with no comment.\",\n        \"section\": \"§7 primary の読み取りを避ける効果\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/general-thread-states.html; §4 has no cost statement.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-ANALYZE-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Possible read stall from a fix implied by the text. Not measured on supported versions.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Run EXP-O6-ANALYZE, then state the result or mark it unmeasured with a warning.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The table and bullets show ANALYZE as what fixes estimates, with no cost or warning. The manual lists ANALYZE TABLE among statements tied to 'Waiting for table flush'. A developer running it during a long count might create the same chain the guideline warns about for FLUSH.\",\n        \"section\": \"§4 概数の精度\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"§7 text, already marked reasoning and with long transactions unmeasured; requested_23 used a private table with a known change count.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-DRIFT-COUNTER-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Limited: the estimate errs high for the first case. The second can err low.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Say the counters are server-wide, or suggest per-table I\/O summaries, and state the commit-timing limit.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The error estimate uses Innodb_rows_inserted, deleted and updated, which are server-wide, so on a busy multi-table server the estimate is uselessly wide. A long transaction changing rows before the walk and committing during it is not counted.\",\n        \"section\": \"§7 分割の合計の誤差\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"No boundary_deletes_and_errors section in requested_11-*.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R3-LOOPEDGE-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Completion rate on string keys is unknown; the failure is safe.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Re-run after the script 11 fix.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Abort frequency under boundary deletes and the other-error stop remain unexercised.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 SQL 4 規則 3, エラーの表\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_12 section_errors. §1 marks it 未実行.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R3-HINT-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"A safety rule is unverified.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Fix the timer and run it.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The long-success rule is unexecuted because the KILL timer hit the next statement.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 SQL 0, SQL 2\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"R6_types absent.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R2-CURSOR-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Lossy-client behaviour rests on reasoning.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Run the R6 arms.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"latin1, double-rounding and decimal arms have no result.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 SQL 4 規則 3\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"O2_3_cascade_triggers absent. The text is marked documented and unmeasured.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R2-CASCADE-VER-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Counter design on newer lines is unverified.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Run it in its own script.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The cascade trigger behaviour on 9.7 and 26.10 has no result.\",\n        \"section\": \"§9\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_53 skipped.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-KEY-ENUM-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"May reject a usable path.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Run EXP-R1 after the priority items.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The rejection is safe. The scaling reason is unmeasured and the per-value walk is only a candidate.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 SQL 3, §6\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"R6_types absent.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-KEY-TYPE-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Exclusions are safe but unverified.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Run the R6 arms with step limits.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"FLOAT, BIT and SET stay undetermined.\",\n        \"section\": \"§1 SQL 3, §6\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_44 monitor_lost_privilege 1044; kill.req_killer_kills_other_user 1095. https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/kill.html and https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/account-categories.html: CONNECTION_ADMIN also needs SYSTEM_USER to affect a SYSTEM_USER session.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-PRIV-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"A monitor user may fail to stop a job owned by a system account.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Fix login, test KILL on a non-SYSTEM_USER target, and cite the manual.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Privilege-loss monitoring failed on login with a database the account has no grant on. The KILL row says undetermined though the manual settles the cause.\",\n        \"section\": \"§8 権限\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_54 skipped; sampling is rejected by reasoning alone.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-BETTER-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"A better method may be missing.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Run EXP-SOL-9 and add the sampling arm.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Parallel read settings, a small index, an invisible index, multi-row counters and sampling have no measurement.\",\n        \"section\": \"§10\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_43 phases.inplace_private: later ddl_ms null.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-MDL-TRIAL-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"The INPLACE wait position is unverified.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Use a unique index name, drop between trials, and re-run.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The INPLACE phase arm has one valid trial.\",\n        \"section\": \"§5\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"§12 last paragraph; my search returned the KILL, account-categories and thread-state pages only.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-DOC-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Marked as such, so no wrong claim is known.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Move the KILL item to confirmed; Sol or a later round checks the rest.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Some pages remain unconfirmed. I confirmed the KILL and SYSTEM_USER rules; multi-valued indexes, the Max_execution_time_exceeded session meaning, UPDATE_TIME after restart and the SELECT FK statement are not confirmed by me.\",\n        \"section\": \"§12\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"evidence\": \"Same as FIND-STEP-01; requested_10 ran preflight on 58 tables.\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-PREFLIGHT-01\",\n        \"impact\": \"Tracked with FIND-STEP-01.\",\n        \"requiredCorrection\": \"Close when countlib is changed.\",\n        \"scenario\": \"The preflight works, but the loop lacks the rules it depends on.\",\n        \"section\": \"§4\",\n        \"severity\": \"low\",\n        \"status\": \"open\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"opusFindingAssessment\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-IMPACT-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_30〜32の9腕を確認。33、60〜63はskipped。高負荷の反復と対照がない。\",\n        \"blocking\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-STEP-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"countlibの分類・幅縮小と本文を照合。本文は未統合を正しく開示するが、実行済みの手順とは呼べない。\",\n        \"blocking\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R6-MDL-AS-TIMEOUT\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_13の4回の3024とunsplittableを確認。本文のPENDING確認は正しい修正だが未実装。\",\n        \"blocking\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-REPL-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"3回とも対応出力がnull。replicaには固有UUIDのGTIDがあり、全GTID集合の文字列一致という実装にも問題がある。\",\n        \"blocking\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-NOISE-FLOOR-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"旧無処置試験の中区間の膨張とrequested_31のp95・p99を確認。ただし原因がハーネスだとの断定はできない。\",\n        \"blocking\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-INSTRUMENT-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"17腕中16腕のp50低下を確認。計測上の交絡は未解決。ただし『カウントが点読みを速めることはない』という前提は採用しない。同じ表の走査なのでキャッシュ効果もあり得る。CPU起床説は仮説。\",\n        \"blocking\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-WRITE-SHAPE-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"DENSEは非索引statusのみ更新。MVCCによるクラスタ索引参照は[公式文書](https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/innodb-multi-versioning.html)でも確認。可変索引の分割は本文で禁止済みなので、その腕は負の対照として扱う。\",\n        \"blocking\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-LONG-UNDO-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"延長分岐にundoの開始・停止ゲートがない。HLLだけからundo容量や安全時間を保証する修正案には限定が必要。\",\n        \"blocking\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-WALK-CEILING-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"split_countの既定max_stepsはNoneで、同値以外の退行検査と全体時間上限がない。script11の原因特定は未実測のまま保持する。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-THREADS-FILTER-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"CountMonitorのLIKEは全サーバー対象。本文の追加OR句はrequested_12で未実行。全体のflush待ちを残しつつ、無関係な表のMDL待ちを区別する必要がある。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-MDL-HEADLINE-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"旧カウント18.68秒と5秒後のALTER待ち13.74秒は整合する。新しい5.72〜6.90秒の計測と同じ試行ではない。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-COLD-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"evictは無関係な2表のCOUNTで、プールからの完全退避を検査していない。cold\/warmのディスク読みもほぼ同じ。完全にcoldでないとの断定より、cold状態を証明していないという範囲で確認。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-QUIET-GATE-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"quiet=falseのまま実験へ進むことと、statement textがnullのSuspending行を確認。システムスレッドだとの同定は未確定。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-REPLICA-ISOLATION-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"旧試験のprimary write p50 2.06→4.22msと対照2.0msを確認。共有ホストの因果は未特定だが、隔離の効果を定量的に示したとは言えない。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-ANALYZE-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"[General Thread States](https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/general-thread-states.html)にANALYZEとtable flush待ちの関係がある。現行版のInnoDBで必ず同じ連鎖になることは未実測。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-O6-DRIFT-COUNTER-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"requested_23は既知の単一行autocommit変更数で評価した。全サーバーの物理変更カウンタはそのコミット列と同等ではない。per-table I\/O集計にもコミット整合性の保証はない。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R3-LOOPEDGE-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"11の境界削除・その他エラー節は保存されていない。本文の上限付き存在確認とその他エラー停止は修正済み。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R3-HINT-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"12の失敗ログはlong-success腕の1317。上限超過成功の検出結果はない。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R2-CURSOR-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"R6_typesが全5版で欠落。無損失型とUTF-8往復という本文修正は確認したが、負の対照の結果はない。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R2-CASCADE-VER-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"SESSIONとnative FK条件は本文にあるが、11の該当節は未保存。既定が変更されたとの主張としては扱わない。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-KEY-ENUM-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"53はskipped。静止状態のENUM比較はcount_shapesにあるが、規模に対する伸びと値別の代替経路は未検証。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-KEY-TYPE-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"FLOAT、BIT、SETは安全側へ除外され、R6の実行結果はない。DOUBLEの静止成功試験が既にある点は区別する。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-PRIV-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"44の1044は試験前ログイン失敗。1095のSYSTEM_USER条件は[Account Categories](https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/account-categories.html)の原文で確認。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-BETTER-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"54はskipped。代替方式の採否が未決。samplingは実数の代替ではなく概数としてのみ比較する。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-MDL-TRIAL-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"43のINPLACEは最初の2733.1msだけ成功。他はnullまたは1061。INSTANTの15回は有効。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-DOC-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"文書一覧の更新は必要。ただし未確認項目の全部がなお未知という扱いは採用しない。今回、[多値索引](https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/create-index.html)、[UPDATE_TIME](https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/information-schema-tables-table.html)、[タイムアウトカウンタの定義](https:\/\/dev.mysql.com\/doc\/refman\/8.4\/en\/server-status-variables.html)、SYSTEM_USER条件を原文確認した。カウンタのセッション別挙動はraw実測も根拠となる。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"FIND-PREFLIGHT-01\",\n        \"assessment\": \"confirm\",\n        \"evidence\": \"preflightの58表結果と現行実装を確認。旧サイズ閾値は除去された。残る問題はsplit_countの未統合規則であり、独立した性能不具合として重複計上しない。\",\n        \"blocking\": false\n      }\n    ],\n    \"findingDispositions\": [\n      {\n        \"disposition\": \"closed for text\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-R2-KILL-01\",\n        \"note\": \"カウンタ25\/25、先行KILL19\/19、経過時間による誤判定5\/19を再確認。本文修正を受け入れる。ループへの統合はFIND-STEP-01。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"disposition\": \"open middle\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-STEP-01\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"disposition\": \"closed for count and duration\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-PK-01\",\n        \"note\": \"requested_26、27で件数と所要を確認。無悪化の一般化はFIND-O6-INSTRUMENT-01。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"disposition\": \"closed\",\n        \"id\": \"FIND-DRIFT-01\",\n        \"n